{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "The Big Argument", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Broken Heart", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Show You Understand Someone's Feelings or Situation", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It is common to show you understand someone's feelings in a conversation. <br/>You use \u201c<span class=\"italic\">I wish ... </span>\u201d to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The verb <span class=\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. After <span class=\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I wish I knew ...<br/>I wish I had ...<br/>I wish you were ...", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/>Wish + Simple Past tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish family members didn't behave like this.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'd like family members to behave differently, but they don't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wish I had time to finish the story now.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" I'd like to finish the story now, but I can't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect Continuous vs. Present Perfect Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use these tenses to express that an action began in the past and is still going on or has just finished. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect tense</span> mainly to express that an action is completed or to emphasize the result. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Forms:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regular verbs: form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + base form of verb + <span class=\"italic\">-ed</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I've watched many movies set in Italy.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Irregular verbs: form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + past participle of irregular verbs", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I haven't heard the story yet.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>You use the <span class=\"italic\">Present Perfect Continuous tense</span> to emphasize the duration or continuous course of an action.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form of <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + been + base form of verb + <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">Example: I've been planning the party for two months.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"has/have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"verb+ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"planning the activity <span class=\\\"strong\\\">for</span> 2 months.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"have\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"been\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" planning the party <span class=\\\"strong\\\">since</span> August.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<ul><li>You use FOR to talk about how long an action has been happening (a week, 2 days, five hours, six years etc.)</li><li>You use SINCE to talk about when the action started (2010, Monday, August)</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: I've been planning a party for my parents. Have I told you the story of how they met?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: No. I haven't heard it yet.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "anniversary", "type": "name"}, {"content": "day of the year when two people were married", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My parent's 50th anniversary party is tonight. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you tell a story about a relationship.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "wedding", "type": "name"}, {"content": "ceremony uniting two people in marriage", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The story is even more amazing when you consider the wedding almost never happened.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "enthralled", "type": "name"}, {"content": "spellbound; enchanted; captivated", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was so enthralled with him, she stayed three weeks longer than planned.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "argument", "type": "name"}, {"content": "conflictual communication between two or more people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My mother had a big argument with my grandmother. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "upsetting", "type": "name"}, {"content": "describes something that makes you feel angry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It was quite upsetting for both of them.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "miserable", "type": "name"}, {"content": "terrible; awful ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It made my mother feel miserable. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le01ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a 12 to 15 line script for a soap opera.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Set the scene.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "One of the female characters is making dinner for her boyfriend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain what she has done already.<br/><br/>Role Play with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The girl's mother comes over to the apartment.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "She doesn't like her daughter's boyfriend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The daughter doesn't want her mother to know about the date.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The mother is suspicious and asks a lot of questions using the present perfect and present perfect continuous.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assess