"Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 11, "type": "DWS"}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "_data": [], "type": "audio", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn8le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn8le01ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn8le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn8le01ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Hi Peter, how are you doing?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Hi Paula, I'm happy because I'm on holiday. How are you?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>:  I'm excited.  My parents' 50th anniversary party is tonight. I've been planning it for over two months now.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Wow, 50 years! That's amazing!"}, {"time": "20000", "image": "engenn8le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Yes, in fact, the story is even more amazing when you consider the wedding almost never happened. Have I told you that story?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No! Please do. I haven't heard it yet.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: My father is Italian, and my mother is American. They met while she was traveling in Italy. She was so enthralled with him, she stayed three weeks longer than planned.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It sounds so romantic. I've watched many movies set in Italy.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: They fell madly in love, but their parents didn't accept the idea of marrying someone from so far away who had a different culture, language and religion. They were very annoyed.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This story is fascinating! It sounds like Romeo and Juliet."}, {"time": "60000", "image": "engenn8le01ob01re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: It is. My mother had a big argument with my grandmother. Of course, it made my mother feel miserable. She was so disappointed.  My father was depressed because she wasn't allowed to write to him. He had a broken heart.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's so sad. I wish family members didn't behave like this.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Yes, it was quite upsetting for both of them.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What happened?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I wish I had time to finish the story now, but I have to go now! Sorry!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Paula!!"}]}}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}